-- test: an operation's condition has the restrictions of a `requires` clause: a `Bool` (U2001) of the refinement language (U2014: not `checked`, `attempt`, an operation or a lambda), no opaque predicate (U2016), no `result` (U2012), no `it` (U2013), over names in scope (ADR 0092 rule 1, spec/05 §3)
-- spec: spec/05 §3
-- expect: error U2001 at src/pricing.una:24:40
-- expect: error U2012 at src/pricing.una:29:40
-- expect: error U2013 at src/pricing.una:34:40
-- expect: error U2014 at src/pricing.una:39:40
